\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia \highlight\uc2 's c.bank says it  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  market to avoid volatility\b0\par\par\uc2 147 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Mai 2019\par 05:11\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2019 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 KUALA LUMPUR, May 29 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Wednesday it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the ringgit \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to avoid excessive volatility, after the \uc2 U.S. Treasury\uc2  flagged Malaysia as one of the countries whose \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  practices deserve scrutiny.\par \par \uc2 The Trump administration said on Tuesday no major trading partner met its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  manipulation criteria but nine countries, including China, Japan, South Korea and \b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , required close attention.\par \par \uc2 "\uc2 Bank Negara \b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the last few years has been in both directions of the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market," the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 "Any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is limited to ensuring an orderly market and avoiding excessive volatility of the exchange rate that may affect macroeconomic stability," it said. (Reporting by A. Ananthalakshmi Editing by Jacqueline Wong) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2019-5-29T04:11:26.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020190529ef5t00ckt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
