\par\par \b \uc2 *\uc2 Bank Negara Malaysia\uc2  Asked Non-Resident Banks to Attest They Aren't Engaging in NDF-Related Transactions: Assistant Gov Adnan\b0\par\par\uc2 648 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 November 2016\par 05:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2016, Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2 17 Nov 2016 23:00 ET *\uc2 Bank Negara Malaysia\uc2  Assistant Gov Adnan: Asked Onshore Banks to Refrain From Facilitating NDFs Transactions From Non-Resident Banks\par \par \uc2 17 Nov 2016 23:00 ET *\uc2 Bank Negara Malaysia\uc2  Adnan: Six Non-Resident Banks Have Attested They Aren't Engaging in NDF-Related Transactions Going Forward\par \par \uc2 17 Nov 2016 23:00 ET *\uc2 Bank Negara Malaysia\uc2  Adnan: Measure Is to Ensure Orderly Market Conditions, to Contain Influence From Offshore Market\par \par \uc2 17 Nov 2016 23:00 ET *\uc2 Bank Negara Malaysia\uc2  Adnan: Measure Is Not New; Used Last September\par \par \uc2 17 Nov 2016 23:00 ET *\uc2 Bank Negara Malaysia\uc2  Adnan: We Don't Recognize Ringgit NDFs Market\par \par \uc2 17 Nov 2016 23:00 ET *\uc2 Bank Negara Malaysia\uc2  Adnan: Less Than 20 NDFs Players in the Market\par \par \uc2 17 Nov 2016 23:00 ET *\uc2 Bank Negara Malaysia\uc2  Adnan: There Will Be No Capital Controls, Never Discussed This\par \par \uc2 17 Nov 2016 23:00 ET *\uc2 Bank Negara Malaysia\uc2  Adnan: There Is Total of 58 Onshore Banks\par \par \uc2 17 Nov 2016 23:00 ET *\uc2 Bank Negara Malaysia\uc2  Adnan: No Further Measures Planned to Apply to NDFs\par \par \uc2 17 Nov 2016 23:00 ET *\uc2 Bank Negara Malaysia\uc2  Adnan: Plan to Accelerate the Roll-Out of Market Development Initiatives to Enhance Onshore Market Soon\par \par \uc2 17 Nov 2016 23:17 ET  Malaysia's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Gets Six Foreign Banks to Pledge Against Trading NDFs\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    By Yantoultra Ngui \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 KUALA LUMPUR, Malaysia--\f28 \uc2 \f2 Malaysia's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has received confirmation from six foreign banks that they won't engage in non deliverable forward-related transactions on the ringgit, its assistant governor Adnan Zaylani Mohamad Zahid said Friday.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "Most of them are within the Asia-Pacific region," Mr. Adnan said in a closed door meeting with selected media, estimating that there are less than 20 NDF players in the market.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 He said \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Negara Malaysia\f28 \uc2 \f2  requested on Friday last week that any non-resident banks operating in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market attested that they weren't engaged in and wouldn't engage in any nondeliverable forward-related transactions involving the ringgit. The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  made the request via Malaysia's 58 onshore banks.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The ringgit has been Asia's worst performing \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  since \f28 \uc2 \f2 Donald Trump\f28 \uc2 \f2  won the U.S. presidential election last week.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has weakened by more than 4% since the election results despite \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Negara Malaysia\f28 \uc2 \f2 's attempt to clamp down on offshore trading.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Write to Yantoultra Ngui at yantoultra.ngui@wsj.com\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 18 Nov 2016 00:03 ET *\f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Negara Malaysia\f28 \uc2 \f2  Assistant Gov Adnan: We Have 'Stepped In' to Defend Ringgit\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 18 Nov 2016 00:03 ET *\f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Negara \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Malaysia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Adnan: Methods Include Market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Providing Liquidity, Attestation on NDFs\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 18 Nov 2016 00:03 ET *\f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Negara Malaysia\f28 \uc2 \f2  Adnan Didn't Specify if Bank Directly Bought/Sold \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 18 Nov 2016 00:12 ET \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Negara Malaysia\f28 \uc2 \f2  'Stepped In' to Defend Ringgit\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    By Yantoultra Ngui \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 KUALA LUMPUR, Malaysia--\f28 \uc2 \f2 Malaysia's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has entered markets to defend the ringgit after the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  weakened more than 4% against the U.S dollar following \f28 \uc2 \f2 Donald Trump\f28 \uc2 \f2 's victory in the U.S. presidential election last week, its assistant governor said Friday.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "We have stepped in a number of ways, usually we step in by market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  provides liquidity, and we are doing that right now," Bank Negara Malaysia assistant governor Adnan Zaylani Mohamad Zahid said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Mr. Adnan didn't specify if the bank directly bought and sold \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Among the measures taken by the bank were requests to non-resident banks operating in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market to confirm they wouldn't engage in non deliverable forward-related transactions involving the ringgit, he added.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Write to Yantoultra Ngui at yantoultra.ngui@wsj.com\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 November 18, 2016 00:12 ET (05:12 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020161118ecbi000er\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
