\par\par \b \uc2 Malaysia: Capital Control On The Cards? -- Barron's Blog\b0\par\par\uc2 By Shuli Ren   \par \uc2 251 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 August 2015\par 04:20\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2015, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 The Malaysian ringgit dipped another 2% to trade at 4.2560 per dollar this morning.\par \par \uc2 Malaysia's foreign reserves fell $2.2 billion over the last two weeks, to $94.5 billion on August 14. This means \uc2 Bank Negara \b \highlight22\uc2 Malaysia\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to stem the slide on the ringgit.\par \par \uc2 The ringgit has fallen more than 16% since the start of the year.\par \par \uc2 But few traders think \uc2 Malaysia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has enough reserves to prop up its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Malaysia's foreign reserves have fallen by almost 50% from their peak of $141 billion in May 2013 (just slightly over a year ago).\par \par \uc2 Malaysia's government has come out assuring the markets that it won't launch a capital control, which it did during the 1998 Asian Crisis Crisis. "We do not think capital controls are likely, but cannot rule out the risk, despite assurance from officials, including Governor Zeti and PM Najib, if \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves continue to be depleted at such a rapid rate," wrote \uc2 Bank of America Merrill Lynch\uc2  analyst Hak Bin Chua.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 iShares MSCI Malaysia ETF\uc2  ( EWM) fell 19.3% in August.\par \par \uc2 See also my last weekend's column " The Perfect Time to Visit Kazakhstan" for more details on ringgit's spectacular fall. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  More at Barron's Asia Stocks to Watch blog, \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://blogs.barrons.com/asiastocks/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://blogs.barrons.com/asiastocks/}}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 August 23, 2015 22:20 ET (02:20 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020150824eb8o0001s\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
